B.cbB=new A.b7("Profitability","Revenue up, profit down","Sales increased while profit decreased.","Compare gross margin, discounts, product mix and operating costs before proposing an explanation.","Despite revenue growth, profitability deteriorated, potentially indicating higher operating costs or margin compression.","","","","","\u201cPotentially\u201d signals a hypothesis; confirm it with cost and margin analysis.",null)
